    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "BUSTER",
      "quote": "I’m not a devious man by nature but\n                         when you’re unarmed your tactics\n                         might gotta be downright\n                         Archimedean.",
      "block": 2
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "BUSTER (CONT’D)",
      "quote": "... Now what happened to the music?",
      "block": 3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "IKE",
      "quote": "Joe! Surly Joe! He’s gawn! We’ve a-lost’m!",
      "block": 4
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "IKE (CONT’D)",
      "quote": "... You kilt my brother, you\n                         cowardly, sonofabitch! Gunned ‘im\n                         down when he wasn’t hardly lookin’!",
      "block": 5
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "BUSTER",
      "quote": "I can cut you a little slack, grievin’\n                         as you are, but the fact is Buster Scruggs\n                         don’t shoot nobody in the back and\n                         that sorry sack a bones was more in\n                         the nature of a suicide.",
      "block": 6
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "IKE",
      "quote": "You’re Buster Scruggs?! The West\n                          Texas Twit?",
