      "block": 8
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "BUSTER",
      "quote": "Presume you meant to say “The West\n                          Texas Tit”—on account of that\n                          p’ticular bird’s mellifluous\n                          warble.",
      "block": 9
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "IKE",
      "quote": "Call yerself any damn name you\n                          please! I wanna see you outside—\n                          wearin’ iron!",
      "block": 10
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "BUSTER",
      "quote": "Things have a way of escalatin’ out\n                          here in the West with one thing\n                          leadin’ to another, but I think I\n                          can make pretty short work of this\n                          ramified ol’ sonofagun.",
      "block": 11
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "IKE",
      "quote": "Scruggs! Scru-u-u-u-u-uggs! I’m a-callin’\n                          you out!",
      "block": 12
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "BUSTER",
      "quote": "Well hang in there, pardner, I just\n                          need to buckle on this toolbelt\n                          here.",
      "block": 13
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "BUSTER (CONT’D)",
